(iii) p=11 n=2 equal split over 3 freqs: sum|beta|^(2/nu)/e^(2/nu) = 1.000000000000, 2^-n N/e^2 = 0.8889 (= 1 - K^(1-nu) = 0.8889)
(iii) p=13 n=3 equal split over 4 freqs: sum|beta|^(2/nu)/e^(2/nu) = 1.000000000000, 2^-n N/e^2 = 0.9844 (= 1 - K^(1-nu) = 0.9844)
(iii) p=11 n=4 equal split over 5 freqs: sum|beta|^(2/nu)/e^(2/nu) = 1.000000000000, 2^-n N/e^2 = 0.9984 (= 1 - K^(1-nu) = 0.9984)
(iii) single own feature: max sqrt(Q^2s + 2^-n R^2)/(B P^s) - 1 = -1.14e-02 (<= 0)
